  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1601.01 Purpose. These rules implement RSA 485-A:4, XVI-a by establishing standards, criteria, and procedures for a permit system to manage the removal, transportation, and disposal of septage, including the processing and treatment thereof, in order to protect human health and the environment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
